    {
      "title": "Update 75",
      "date": "2025-03-27 10:00:12",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795283637820719",
      "content": "1. Normal enemies now gain a \"hit\" state, making them unable to move for 0.4 seconds when struck.  \n2. Fixed some bugs."
    },
    {
      "title": "Update 74",
      "date": "2025-03-26 11:44:17",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795283637790178",
      "content": "1. Further optimized the game; frame rates should now be more stable. The hardware requirements have been lowered. If you encounter any issues, please post a report."
    },
    {
      "title": "Update #73 (New Content)",
      "date": "2025-03-24 15:10:22",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794830911009006",
      "content": "1. Enabled the **Item Codex** feature, allowing players to view all currently available dropable items in the game. Hovering over an item will display its basic details.  \n2. Players can view all items or use the sidebar to filter by category.  \n3. Weapons have a **secondary filter**, allowing selection by weapon type."
    },
    {
      "title": "Update 72 (New Content)",
      "date": "2025-03-23 15:49:05",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794830910977214",
      "content": "1. Added Codex Feature  \nThe \"Talent Codex\" is now available, allowing players to view all talents, including unlocked and locked talents."
    },
    {
      "title": "Update 71",
      "date": "2025-03-22 07:44:45",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794830910934802",
      "content": "1. Random talents, talent energy values, and unclaimed talents are now saved upon exiting the game. They will only be cleared upon death.  \n2. Talents stolen by enemies are now saved when exiting the game and will be cleared upon player death.  \n3. The settings menu when exiting the game now pauses the game."
    },
    {
      "title": "Update 70 (New Content)",
      "date": "2025-03-17 14:47:56",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528211759",
      "content": "1. Added new active skill: **Arc**  \n2. Added new ancient gem: **Dancing Sparks**  \n\n### Skill Description:  \nA bolt of lightning arcs from the caster to a target in front, then chains to other nearby enemies but does not immediately chain back to the original target. Each time the primary arc chains, it also releases a secondary arc toward another enemy that the primary arc has not yet hit. Secondary arcs cannot chain further. Maximum of 16 chains.  \n\n### Gem Exclusive Bonuses:  \n- **Arc** gains +1 additional chain.  \n- **Arc** releases 2 secondary arcs with each chain."
    },
    {
      "title": "Update #69 (New Content)",
      "date": "2025-03-16 11:11:36",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528174634",
      "content": "New Block Counterattack Skill: \"Divine Retribution\"\n\nSkill Description:\n\nTriggers a counterattack on block, unleashing a surge of divine energy that emits multiple lightning waves expanding outward from the target. This skill cannot be triggered and cannot be used by totems, traps, or mines.\nDeals additional physical damage.\nConverts 50% of physical damage to lightning damage.\nInitially unavailable by default.\nExplosion radius scales with skill level.\nCreates 4 shockwaves.\nEach shockwave erupts 6 times.\nHas a long cooldown, making it a complementary skill for other block counterattack abilities."
    },
    {
      "title": "Update 68 (New Content)",
      "date": "2025-03-15 10:24:07",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528142147",
      "content": "1. Added Ancient Amulet  \"Xiri\u2019s Truth\""
    },
