      "content": "1. Added enemy base level adjustment. You can lower enemy levels in the map interface, but this will reduce item drop rates. Scores achieved at lower levels will not be recorded on the leaderboard.\n2. Added a new active skill: Glacial Shield Strike.\n3. Added a new ancient gem: Frozen Hell."
    },
