    },
    {
      "title": "Update #62 (New Content)",
      "date": "2025-03-03 06:11:39",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792751526135559",
      "content": "1. Added a new dropped item, \"Reincarnation Stone,\" which grants 1-3 Reincarnation Coins upon use.  \n2. Added a new dropped item, \"Reincarnation Crystal,\" which grants 3-6 Reincarnation Coins upon use.  \nReincarnation Coins are the currency used in the Reincarnation Shop and can be spent to purchase items sold by other players."
    },
    {
      "title": "Update #61 (Major Update)",
      "date": "2025-03-01 09:04:56",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792751526076011",
      "content": "1. Added the Reincarnation Market, where players can sell items. The market uses a separate currency, with each account starting with 50.  \n   Currently, the new currency cannot be obtained through drops, but an update will be released in the coming days.  \n2. Fixed some bugs."
    },
    {
      "title": "Version 60 Update (Preparatory Update)",
      "date": "2025-02-28 16:05:02",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792751526053576",
      "content": "1. Updated the item storage standards.  \n2. Added a built-in database.  \n\nThese two updates are preparatory for the upcoming \"Reincarnation Shop\" feature.  \nThe Reincarnation Shop will allow players to trade items with each other, functioning like an auction house."
    },
    {
      "title": "59 Update (New Content)",
