      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792751526008717",
      "content": "1. Added map-exclusive drop feature. Each Endless level has different drops.  \nPS: The exclusive drops for the second map are still in production."
    },
