      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792751525984323",
      "content": "1. The main god space has added a skill testing area. Upon entering the area, you will automatically attack test enemies, which is used to test skill and equipment combinations.  \n2. A real-time DPS display has been added to the top left corner of the interface."
    },
