    {
      "title": "54th Update (New Language Support)",
      "date": "2025-02-14 10:22:26",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1791580426000343",
      "content": "1.New English Support\nHowever, my English is not very good, just at a high school level. Since I\u2019m making the game alone and don\u2019t have the money to hire a translator, I can only learn game-related English while working on it with GPT. So, there will definitely be some translation issues. I can only adjust it step by step. If there are any issues, feel free to leave a message and I\u2019ll make corrections immediately. Thanks for the support."
    },
